//   epoch   : the world board's floor when no contest stands and none has closed (rows before it are filed away).
// A contest: { id, name, prize, short, prizeWords, opens, closes, closeWord, when, endWord, src, test, verify: { firstBuild, softSeventhT } }
//   name/prize/short ride every surface (the title's prize pool, the gate's band, the crown, the leader box, the terms, the winners page);
//   prizeWords and closeWord are the terms' own sentences; when is the archive card's date line; endWord the phone's short close;
//   src the picture we made for it; test marks a first run; verify carries what tools/contest-verify.js needs (the first build that could post, the soft-seventh stamp).
